  "body": "## 更新内容 / What's New（安卓 v0.1.26）\n\n这一版处理三件事。\n\n**微信群里分享的视频号**\n- 视频号卡住退不出时，涟漪会把手机带回桌面，并换成新的提示。以前在部分手机（比如红米 HyperOS）上，涟漪按了返回、拉起微信都没用，只弹提示，视频还能继续看。\n- 如果手机限制了「后台弹出界面」，建议在系统设置里给涟漪打开，这样拦下后能退回微信的聊天列表。\n\n**今天用量和每日限额**\n- 修复部分手机覆盖安装后，今天用量被算多、每日限额被误拦的问题。今天的用量会按零点以后的记录重新算，已经算多的数会自动校正。\n\n**加载时的占位**\n- 首页的「今天用了多久」「今天拦下」和自律APP页的列表，读取数据时先显示灰色占位块，读完再换成数字，不再显示「正在读取…」，也不会先显示 0。\n- 系统开了「减少动画」时，占位是静止的。\n\n**已知限制**\n- 这三项都还没有在真机上验证过，只做了单元测试和界面测试。\n- iPhone 版没有更新，仍是 v0.1.5。\n\n---\n\nThis release covers three things.\n\n**Channels videos shared in a WeChat group**\n- When a video gets stuck and cannot be closed, Ripple now takes the phone back to the home screen and shows a new message. Before, on some phones (for example Redmi HyperOS), going back and relaunching WeChat both failed, so only a message appeared and the video kept playing.\n- If your phone restricts \"Display pop-up windows while running in the background\", allow it for Ripple in system settings so a block can return you to the WeChat chat list.\n\n**Today's usage and daily limits**\n- Fixes today's usage being counted too high, and daily limits blocking apps by mistake, on some phones after an update install. Today's usage is now counted again from records after midnight, and a number that was too high corrects itself.\n\n**Placeholders while loading**\n- On the Today page, the \"Time used today\" and \"Blocked Today\" cards, and on the Daily Limits page, the list shows gray placeholders while data loads, then switches to the numbers. It no longer shows \"Loading...\" or a temporary 0.\n- With \"Reduce motion\" turned on in the system, the placeholders stay still.\n\n**Known limits**\n- None of these three has been verified on a real phone yet, only in unit and screen tests.\n- The iPhone app was not updated and remains v0.1.5.\n\nversionCode: 49\nsha256: 87ace1766fac5f028dc0694befcde6bdd8c1f98e6b1afc7dd06a46a3c3786464\n",
